{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261116/photo/bkn-20261116153940441-1116_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261116161921\"/><p>涉事單位冒出黑煙。</p><p>北角發生火警。今午(16日)3時30分，春秧街55-71號宜安大廈一單位起火冒煙，街坊發現後報案。消防接報趕至，隨即開喉救火。網上影片可見，涉事單位火光熊熊，火勢頗為猛烈，大量黑煙從單位冒出。</p><p>及至下午3時53分，消防將火撲滅，起火原因有待進一步調查。事件中，暫無人受傷，約40名住戶疏散。現場消息稱，單位有5人居住，初步相信電插座及電腦起火。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T08:35:02.399313+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":190,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T07:39:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T08:48:39.302713+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T08:28:39.201302+00:00","content_hash":"c9963bef7c6c6a181ee023da5533484471678fd0a9562cbecbf30ad02980218e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T08:35:02.399313+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}